Amos Guren is a dwarf jeweler in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and the man behind [[Org/Guren and Guren/index|Guren and Guren]]. He wears a three-piece suit, and both his long black beard and the braid down his back are threaded with gemstones. He is careful with strangers and quick to notice when one is not really a buyer.

He knows [[Phenomena/Feyrock|Feyrock]] by its signs and carries a jeweler's monocle, a stack of lenses that flick down over the eye, to sort a real stone from a fake. A bandaged man in a black raiment stopped him on his walk home a few blocks from his office and sold him a Feyrock necklace set in a gold chain for twenty thousand gold pieces, far under what the stone was worth. Guren took it without asking where it came from.

When the investigators showed him a Feyrock of their own, he confirmed it was real and offered to buy any they cared to part with.
